                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What a stunning game. I loved it more than I expected!\nThe characters are interesting, your choices really have an impact, the music is super nice and the exploration of the peninsula is quite the adventure. That being said, you have to read a lot BUT it's never useless trivia or boring stuff. Everything you find, every person/thing you talk to or about will give you information that might help you later. So it's never wasted time.\nAs for time: on easy mode there is no time limit, normal 40 days and hard 30 days. I played as a scholar on normal and it was so much fun!\nTip: if you catch a fish and you don't sell or cook it in the next days it will spoil and please wash yourself! ;p",
